    - ProGuard/R8 keep rules for engine classes
    - ABI split decisions (arm64-v8a primary) to limit APK size


================================================================================
15. ACCEPTANCE CHECKLIST
================================================================================

  [ ] Passive pass proceeds without any user action
  [ ] Passive low score auto-starts a random active challenge
  [ ] User cannot choose the challenge; sequence differs between sessions
  [ ] PAD detection blocks capture/auth and shows only the generic message
  [ ] Print, screen and replay test set blocked; APCER/BPCER report produced
  [ ] Retry limit enforced; onRepeatedFailure modes work, lockout survives restart
  [ ] Same behaviour in airplane mode for resident, operator, supervisor
  [ ] Gate expiry and session binding enforced before capture/match
  [ ] All 13 listed error conditions mapped and tested
  [ ] Disabling liveness via config is impossible without the build flag
  [ ] Two frame-source adapters (mock + CameraX or real SBI) pass the same suite
  [ ] Audit events present; no biometric images in logs or storage
  [ ] Meets performance targets on the low-end test device
